# Public site freeze

`index.html`, `demo/index.html`, `developers/index.html`, `ad-submission/index.html`, and `css/styles.css` are locked.

- Do not restyle, relaunch, rewrite, or "improve" public HTML or CSS.
- Do not push layout, type, color, or copy changes that trigger a new Pages deploy.
- Production is Git-connected Cloudflare Pages on `main`. One stable snapshot. No Wrangler deploys.

Read `mem/current.md` first. Unlock only when Daniel explicitly says to change a public page.

Rejected and do not restore: homepage category form, `js/sandbox.js` as the visitor UI, justified copy, two-tone page washes, `linear-gradient` overlays, or `::before`/`::after` paints on html/body/main. Body stays left; only short headlines and CTAs center.

```text
❌ BAD  New homepage layout, palette pass, or font-size sweep
❌ BAD  Tailwind CDN, default index boilerplate, linear-gradient wash
❌ BAD  Restore the old sandbox form
❌ BAD  npx wrangler pages deploy / wrangler deploy
✅ GOOD Leave public HTML and CSS as committed
✅ GOOD Docs, rules, and mem/current.md only if asked
```
